  "details": "Hello I am playing on oculus quest two and I can’t play for more than 10 minutes without the game crashing and if I decide to record a video it crashes almost every five minutes it is almost unbearable to play. It has gotten a little bit better over the updates, but it still crashes a lot sometimes almost unbearable to play the game and it’s annoying because I’m sitting in a lobby waiting to start up a game named just keep running and it just crashes randomly and it’s just really annoying because I’m doing absolutely nothing standing and it just crashes, plus if I’m in a game sometimes it lags a lot. I get really trash FPS.\n\nThank you, VRchat Team.",
